@startuml
title stm — Association
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description

[*] --> Active : sign up (UC1)

state Active : members write\npublic pages online
state Suspended : public 410\nno member writes\ndisputable (UC9)
state Closed : "Association closed" page\nslug reserved, keys revoked

Active --> Suspended : suspend (UC31)\n[reason, 7 d / 30 d / no limit]
Suspended --> Active : duration ends (scheduled job)
Suspended --> Active : lifted on dispute (UC32)
Active --> Closed : close (UC8)\n[actor is last member]
Active --> Closed : last member deletes account (UC6)
Suspended --> Closed : last member deletes account (UC6)\n[GDPR right; close (UC8) is blocked (S1)]
Closed --> [*] : 30 days elapsed and no active suspension\n(content and log deleted)
@enduml
